    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 286, 396, 120]
    elementId: box-in
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $beige, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [80, 300, 364, 96]
    content:
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 12
      color: $ink
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>若干供应商的报价文件混在一起：</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px"><span style="color:$gray">.xlsx / .xls / .pdf（电子版+扫描件）/ .jpg / .png / .txt / .csv</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px"><span style="color:$green">每个文件 = 一家供应商的一次报价</span></p>
    elementId: box-in-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [500, 262, 240, 16]
    content:
      style: $mono
      text: 输出 · 三份产物
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-out
    elementType: text
  - border: {color: $green, style: solid, width: 1}
    bounds: [500, 286, 396, 120]
    elementId: box-out
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [516, 300, 364, 96]
    content:
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 12
      color: $ink
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>&gt; 比价 Excel：比价总表 / 明细数据 / 统计与异常</p>
        <p>&gt; result.json：完整结构化结果，供程序二次消费</p>
        <p>&gt; report.txt：人读摘要</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px"><span style="color:$green">最低价绿、超均价红、缺报灰、存疑黄</span></p>
    elementId: box-out-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 436, 832, 22]
    content:
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 14
      color: $ink
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>一句话：<strong>多格式报价单 → 统一结构化数据 → 一张带预警标色的横向比价表</strong>，纯本地运行。</p>
      wrap: false
    elementId: oneline
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 478, 560, 16]
    content:
      style: $small
      text: 技术分享 · 报价单提取比价工具
      wrap: false
    elementId: footer
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [860, 478, 36, 16]
    content:
      style: $mono
      fontSize: 12
      align: [right, top]
      text: '05'
      wrap: false
    elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
